      "page_id": "HUAWEI_MatePad User Guide-(BAH4-W09&L09,HarmonyOS 2_01,en)_00071",
      "chunk_type": "text",
      "text": "Set a SIM PIN Lock\nIf you\nexceed the maximum number of attempts allowed to unlock the PUK, your SIM card will be\npermanently blocked.\nThe PIN and PUK of your SIM card are provided by your carrier. The number of digits and\nmaximum number of attempts allowed to unlock your PIN and PUK are subject to your\ncarrier.\n1 Go to Settings > Security > More settings to enter the SIM lock settings screen.\n2 Enable Lock SIM card, enter the PIN, then touch OK.",
