      "chunk_type": "text",
      "text": "Pin Service Widgets on the Home Screen\nIf there is no space available on the current screen, it will be pinned to the next screen. If\nneither screen has any space, a new screen will be created to the right of the current screen\nfor the service widget.\n• You can add different styles of service widgets for the same app.\n• Service widgets cannot be pinned to folders.",
